lines:
You’re the first Trainer I’ve seen who
deploys Pokémon so masterfully.{be01}
But, I should tell you - my son is
stronger than you.{be01}
He even took the Pokémon League
challenge, I’ll have you know.

We use this Macho Brace to more
effectively strengthen our Pokémon{be00}
in training.{be01}
Since you’ve beaten our entire family,
I don’t know if you need it, but we{be00}
would like you to have our Macho Brace.

显然你很厉害。但是如果你和我的孙
子对战你一定会输到哭泣的。他比我{be01}
们所知道的训练家都要厉害。他现在
一定在挑战联盟冠军吧。你会认识我{be01}
的孙子的，他应该已经是冠军了！
